}

=== RECENT RAISE SESSIONS ===
Student: My email is [EMAIL]

Raise: Please do not share that, [NAME].

Student: ok, Bob Lee says call [PHONE]",
          },
        ],
        "role": "user",
      },
    ],
  },
]
`;

